Camarines Sur, Island of Luzon, bounded on the N., along points 1 to 3 by Lot 1-B-2-C-1; on the NE., along
points 3 to 16 by Lot N-1, (LRC) Psd-107284; on the SE., along points 16 to 24 by Pangel Creek; on the SW
and NW., along points 24 to 1 by Lot N-2-B, of the subdivision plan (creek); Beginning a point marked "1" on
